&lt;h2&gt;Key Findings from Our Review&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep learning outperforms classical methods&lt;/strong&gt; on all benchmarks — but margins are small on clean data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The biggest gap is on noisy / arrhythmic ECGs&lt;/strong&gt; — deep learning is far more robust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real-time requirements&lt;/strong&gt; still favor lightweight CNNs or optimized Pan-Tompkins variants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-dataset generalization remains a challenge&lt;/strong&gt; — train on MIT-BIH, test on PTB, performance drops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
